000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. FUNC1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 01  WS-TEXT             PIC X(20) VALUE "  Hello, World  ".
000060 01  WS-AMOUNT-TEXT      PIC X(10) VALUE "1,234.50".
000070 01  WS-AMOUNT           PIC 9(5)V99.
000080 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
